|ITIL practice                      |Application in this model                                                                                                            |
|-----------------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|**Monitoring and event management**|Monitoring engineering provides the capability; command center performs operational event handling.                                  |
|**Incident management**            |Command center and designated incident managers coordinate; technical resolver teams restore services.                               |
|**Problem management**             |A named problem owner tracks causes, known workarounds, and corrective actions across technical teams.                               |
